/obj/item/paper/fluff{
	pixel_x = -4;
	pixel_y = 1;
	default_raw_text = "Alright, so we've been settled here for a few years now, Nanotrasen keeps a close eye on us and all that, however we haven't been able to communicate at all to them. We send them faxes, but receive no responses. I'm starting to worry if something's interrupting our faxes. And not just that, there's been lights I've seen out in the distance in the wild, trudging through the snow. It's usually during the blizzards so it's really hard to see. I'm starting to worry that maybe we're being staked out to be pirated. If I were to guess it's those soviet russians remnants again we had a few weeks ago. But this? No.. This is way too advanced, and cautious. I'm gonna bring it up to the Director soon, and notify the private security about what I've been seeing.. Knowing them they'd probably just be lazy.. But it's better than nothing.";
	name = "technician's concerned note"
	},
/turf/open/floor/iron/textured,
/area/ruin/nsl_mining_colony/refinery)
